<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 19.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers (dollar/bu)</p>
<p>					South of Peoria  change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.64-2.69		unc-dn 3</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 6.97-7.02		dn 6-10</p>
<p>			  Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.71-2.75		dn 1-2</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Soybeans		 7.04-7.06		dn 5-9</p>
<p>				   North of Peoria</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.66-2.68		dn 1</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 6.96-7.00		dn 8-10</p>
<p>			    Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.68-2.72		dn 1-2</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 6.99-7.02		dn 7-8</p>
<p>Source: USDA (Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
